[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0728","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0728.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21269","title":"Microsoft Windows HTML 平台安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Windows HTML 平台存在安全功能绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的恶意网站触发该漏洞，导致目标系统绕过 Windows HTML 平台的安全机制。该漏洞源于对 HTML 内容的权限校验不充分，攻击者利用此漏洞可获取受限资源的低权限访问，造成机密性影响。攻击需要用户交互（如点击恶意链接），无法直接远程利用。CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21269"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:56Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。各版本修复版本号：Windows 10 1507 需升级至 10.0.10240.20890，Windows 10 22H2 需升级至 10.0.19045.5371，Windows 11 24H2 需升级至 10.0.26100.2894，Windows Server 2022 需升级至 10.0.20348.3091。临时缓解措施可配置 IE 安全区域为高等级并禁用 ActiveX 控件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21269","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21269.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21269.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21269.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21269.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21269.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21269.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/eaba6ba6891dae2972376e68ae56a38b641030d7/2025/CVE-2025-21269.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21269","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/