-2025-0720","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0720.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21261","title":"Microsoft Windows 数字媒体特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 数字媒体组件存在越界读取漏洞，该漏洞源于对内存边界检查不足。已获得低权限并具备物理访问权限的攻击者可利用此漏洞读取越界内存内容，进而实现权限提升，获取系统最高权限。攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互即可完成利用。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21261"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:55Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：Windows Server 2008 安装 KB5050061（仅安全更新）或 KB5050063（月度汇总），Windows 10 1809 安装 KB5050008，Windows Server 2008 R2 安装 KB5050049。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。由于该漏洞需要物理访问才能利用（CVSS 攻击向量为 Physical），限制对受影响系统的物理访问可作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21261","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21261.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bc943eb819a406135c2391ed30d595e2ea60281b/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21261.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21261.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21261.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21261.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21261.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5ed23ad1e6e5869267a4c8091cffdf6711227b5/2025/CVE-2025-21261.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21261","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21261.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21261"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0720.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0719","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0719.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21260","title":"Microsoft Windows 数字媒体特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 数字媒体组件存在越界读取漏洞，该漏洞源于对内存中对象读取操作边界检查不充分。具有物理访问权限的低权限攻击者可通过向目标系统插入特制媒体设备或运行恶意应用程序触发该漏洞，成功利用后可导致系统内存敏感信息泄露，进而实现权限提升，获取对机密性、完整性和可用性的高等级控制。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多个版本，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21260"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:55Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)。各受影响版本对应的修复版本号：Windows 10 v1507 升级至 10.0.10240.20890，v1607/Server 2016 升级至 10.0.14393.7699，v1809/Server 2019 升级至 10.0.17763.6775，v21H2 升级至 10.0.19044.5371，v22H2 升级至 10.0.19045.5371，Windows 11 v22H2 升级至 10.0.22621.4751，v23H2 升级至 10.0.22631.4751，v24H2/Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.2894，Server 2022 升级至 10.0.20348.3091，Server 2022 23H2 升级至 10.0.25398.1369。也可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。由于该漏洞需要物理访问才能利用，限制本地登录权限可作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21260","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21260.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bc943eb819a406135c2391ed30d595e2ea60281b/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21260.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21260.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21260.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21260.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21260.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc3c209ab3b380e61580f037335fd28cb053661f/2025/CVE-2025-21260.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21260","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21260.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21260"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0719.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0717","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0717.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21258","title":"Microsoft Windows 数字媒体特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 数字媒体组件存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125），攻击者通过物理接触目标设备并以低权限运行特制程序即可触发该漏洞。成功利用后，攻击者可实现权限提升至内核级别，完整控制系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性的全面损失。该漏洞影响范围极广，覆盖 Windows 10 全系列版本（1507 至 22H2）、Windows 11 全系列版本（22H2 至 24H2），以及 Windows Server 2008 至 2025 等多个服务器版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议受影响用户尽快安装安全补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21258"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:55Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月累计安全更新（KB5050021 Windows 10/11、KB5050009 Windows Server 2016/2019/2022、KB5050061 Windows Server 2008 SP2 ESU）以修复该漏洞。先安装最新 Servicing Stack Update KB5050682 再应用安全更新。若暂时无法打补丁，可通过组策略禁用 \"Windows Media Player Network Sharing Service\" 服务（WMPNetworkSvc）作为临时缓解措施，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21258","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21258.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bc943eb819a406135c2391ed30d595e2ea60281b/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21258.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21258.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21258.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21258.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21258.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a7beb68728b0af7e95464487f27d2fd3a97523c/2025/CVE-2025-21258.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21258","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21258.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21258"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0717.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0716","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0716.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21257","title":"微软 Windows 信息披露漏洞","description":"Windows WLAN AutoConfig 服务存在信息泄露漏洞，源于服务在处理无线网络配置数据时未正确验证边界，导致越界读取内存（CWE-125）。本地攻击者利用低权限账户即可触发该漏洞，无需用户交互，可读取进程内存中的敏感信息（如凭据、会话令牌等）。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等版本，CVSS 评分 5.5（中危），攻击向量为本地，机密性影响高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议尽快应用补丁 KB5049981 以降低风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21257"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:55Z","remediation":"立即安装 Windows 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5049981 以修复此信息泄漏漏洞。对于受影响的 Windows 10 版本 1607-22H2、Windows 11 版本 22H2-24H2 和 Windows Server 2016-2025 系统，请启用 Windows Update 自动更新。如无法立即打补丁，请禁用 WLAN AutoConfig 服务并限制无线网络访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21257","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21257.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bc943eb819a406135c2391ed30d595e2ea60281b/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21257.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/038ebe8769d42a55c13282848dec427251956ad1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21257.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/038ebe8769d42a55c13282848dec427251956ad1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21257.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21257.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21257.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4f65f772070b3f93cf10dae516c0292b5e70e1bb/2025/CVE-2025-21257.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21257.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21257","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21257.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0716.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0715","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0715.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21256","title":"Microsoft Windows 数字媒体 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 数字媒体组件存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过构造恶意媒体文件或特制输入，利用数字媒体处理逻辑中的边界检查缺陷触发堆溢出，进而实现权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及对应 Server 版本，CVSS 评分 6.6（中危），攻击向量为物理接触（AV:P），需低权限用户交互，无需用户干预即可利用。成功利用可导致机密性、完整性、可用性全面受损。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21256"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:54Z","remediation":"请立即安装 Windows 安全更新程序 KB5050061（适用于所有受影响 Windows 版本，包括 Windows 10 1507-22H2、Windows 11 22H2-24H2 以及 Windows Server 2008-2025），此更新修复数字媒体组件中的权限提升漏洞。确保更新到 2025 年最新的累积更新包。如无法立即更新，可临时禁用不必要的数字媒体服务并限制低权限用户对相关注册表项的访问权限，以降低攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21256","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21256.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0812ebe932b97710173c59d3d74959fb420956eb/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21256.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21256.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21256.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21256.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21256.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/30757a66c9ec8372e159aadb0aa3af74af2b2bdf/2025/CVE-2025-21256.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21256","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21256.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21256"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0715.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0714","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0714.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21255","title":"微软 数字媒体 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 数字媒体组件存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125），攻击者需具备物理访问权限且低权限即可利用。该漏洞源于数字媒体组件在处理特定媒体文件时未正确验证输入边界，导致越界读取内存数据。攻击者可通过诱导用户插入包含恶意构造内容的存储介质，或在已获得物理访问权限的情况下直接操作目标设备，触发越界读取导致敏感信息泄露、系统完整性破坏或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行受影响版本 Windows 的设备，CVSS 评分 6.6（中危），攻击向量为物理接触，攻击复杂度低，需低权限且无需用户交互，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性均受到高度影响。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21255"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:54Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可禁用 Windows Digital Media 相关服务（如 Windows Media Player Network Sharing Service）作为临时缓解措施，并限制本地用户权限防止提权利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21255","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21255.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0812ebe932b97710173c59d3d74959fb420956eb/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21255.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21255.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21255.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21255.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21255.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/10077249260e5fe97e33a99425b1ad7686bc1139/2025/CVE-2025-21255.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21255","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21255.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21255"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0714.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0711","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0711.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21252","title":"Windows Telephony Service Remote Code Execution Vulnerability 漏洞","description":"Windows 电话服务（Telephony Service）存在远程代码执行漏洞，源于 TapiServer.dll 组件在处理畸形输入数据时存在内存处理缺陷（相关类型为 CWE-122）。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意构造的链接或连接至攻击者控制的资源，使系统电话服务解析特定数据，从而在受影响主机上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。利用此漏洞攻击复杂度较低且无需任何特权，但需要用户交互配合才能触发，可能进一步结合权限提升实现完全控制。该漏洞影响主要 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 等版本，CVSS 3.1 评分为 8.8，危害等级为高危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（如 KB5049983、KB5049984 等）中发布修复补丁，建议用户尽快安装更新以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21252"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:54Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5049981，对应 Windows 10/11 与 Windows Server 2022），或通过「设置 → Windows 更新」启用自动更新并重启系统完成部署。该漏洞源于 Telephony Service 对内存对象的处理错误，攻击者需诱导用户在受影响主机上打开恶意文件或访问恶意网站方可远程利用，因此作为临时缓解措施：可在企业边界与终端防火墙上封堵并限制对 control 通信的访问，并通过组策略禁用或限制 Windows 电话服务（Telephony Service，服务名 Tapisrv）的启动类型，同时加强用户安全意识培训，禁止打开来源不明的文件与链接。若无法立即打补丁，请在非必要环境暂缓暴露远程桌面等服务入口，降低被利用面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21252","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21252.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21252.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21252.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21252.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21252.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21252.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7753953b586683c230526e07a6b8b2948b832025/2025/CVE-2025-21252.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21252","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21252.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21252"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0711.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0710","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0710.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21251","title":"Microsoft 消息队列 (MSMQ) 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.<value>CVE-2025-21251 是 Microsoft 消息队列（MSMQ）组件中存在的高危拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于 MSMQ 服务在处理特制消息时对资源控制不当（CWE-400），导致资源消耗失控。攻击者无需任何身份认证，仅需通过网络向目标 MSMQ 服务发送精心构造的消息即可触发，且攻击复杂度低、无需用户交互，可使 MSMQ 服务崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务，严重影响系统可用性，但不影响机密性与完整性。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等多个版本，Microsoft 已通过安全更新 5050061 修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21251"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:54Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21251","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21251.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21251.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21251.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6e